","durationMin":5,"timerSeconds":300,"activeMeasureSummary":"Yeast, Water","creatorSecret":"Prep and measure yeast first—mise en place makes this dessert twice as fast."},{"stepNumber":2,"phaseLabel":"Build Flavor","title":"Dip & Coat Evenly","instructionTemplate":"Heat vegetable oil in deep fryer to 350°. Slide doughnuts into hot oil with wide spatula. Turn doughnuts as they rise to the surface. Fry until golden brown, about 1 minute on each side. Remove carefully from oil (do not prick surface); drain. Dip the doughnuts into creamy glaze set on rack. Incorporate {m53015_5}, {m53015_6}, and {m53015_7} smoothly until evenly distributed.","durationMin":5,"timerSeconds":300,"activeMeasureSummary":"Water, Sugar"},{"stepNumber":3,"phaseLabel":"Combine & Fold","title":"Combine Wet & Dry Smoothly","instructionTemplate":"Fold {m53015_8}, {m53015_9}, {m53015_10}, {m53015_11}, {m53015_12}, {m53015_13}, and {m53015_14} into the base in two additions using gentle strokes until glossy and uniform with zero dry pockets. Avoid overmixing so the final texture stays light and tender.","durationMin":3,"timerSeconds":180,"activeMeasureSummary":"Glossy Batter • Zero Lumps"},{"stepNumber":4,"phaseLabel":"Shape & Layer","title":"Cream Butter & Sugar Fluffy","instructionTemplate":"Heat butter until melted. Remove from heat. Stir in powdered sugar and vanilla until smooth. Stir in water, 1 tablespoon at a time, until desired consistency.","durationMin":18,"timerSeconds":1080,"activeMeasureSummary":"Salt, Eggs","criticalTip":"Let set for 5–10 minutes before slicing or plating so the textures hold crisp and photogenic!","creatorSecret":"Glaze or toss in sugar while still warm so the coating melts lightly and clings to every ridge."}],"ugcQuotes":[{"id":"muq-53015","handle":"@baker_krispy-k","image":"./ai-images/krispy-kreme-donut.jpg","quote":"Followed the scaled metric steps—came out flawless in 33 mins!","rating":5}]}}]
